---
name: adr-new
version: 1.0.0
description: Author one new ADR record as a standalone Markdown file.
required_variables: [id, title, status, version, created, last_updated, owner, decision_date]
defaults:
  supersedes: ""
  superseded_by: ""
  related_documents: ""
  requirements: []
  architecture_decisions: []
  design_documents: []
  work_items: []
  external_references: []
  context: ""
  background: ""
  problem_statement: ""
  decision: ""
  chosen_approach: ""
  key_principles: []
  rationale: ""
  benefits: []
  trade_offs: []
  consequences: ""
  positive: []
  negative: []
  neutral: []
  alternatives: []
  implementation: ""
  key_components: []
  integration_points: []
  code_examples: ""
  impact_analysis: ""
  affected_components: ""
  performance_impact: ""
  security_impact: ""
  maintainability_impact: ""
---
{#- Generated by scripts/authoring_templates.py. Name the problem and the forces behind the decision; give every rejected option its reason; list costs as well as benefits. Each `alternatives` item is an object with `cons`, `description`, `name`, `pros`, `why_rejected`. -#}
{%- macro items(label, values) -%}
{% if values %}
**{{ label }}:**

{% for value in values %}
- {{ value | replace("\n", "\n  ") }}
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro checklist(label, values) -%}
{% if values %}
**{{ label }}:**

{% for value in values %}
- [ ] {{ value | replace("\n", "\n  ") }}
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro text(label, value) -%}
{% if value %}
**{{ label }}:**

{{ value }}

{% endif %}
{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro prose(value) -%}
{% if value %}
{{ value }}

{% endif %}
{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro definitions_paragraph(value) -%}
{% if value %}
Definitions: {{ value }}

{% endif %}
{%- endmacro -%}
# Decision: {{ title }}

**Status:** {{ status }}{{ '  ' }}
**Version:** {{ version }}{{ '  ' }}
**Created:** {{ created }}{{ '  ' }}
**Last Updated:** {{ last_updated }}{{ '  ' }}
**Owner:** {{ owner }}{{ '  ' }}
{% if supersedes %}
**Supersedes:** {{ supersedes }}{{ '  ' }}
{% endif %}
{% if superseded_by %}
**Superseded By:** {{ superseded_by }}{{ '  ' }}
{% endif %}
**Decision Date:** {{ decision_date }}{{ '  ' }}

---

## {{ id }}: {{ title }}

**Status:** {{ status }}{{ '  ' }}

{% if related_documents or requirements or architecture_decisions or design_documents or work_items or external_references %}
### Related Documents

{{ prose(related_documents) }}{{ items("Requirements", requirements) }}{{ items("Architecture Decisions", architecture_decisions) }}{{ items("Design Documents", design_documents) }}{{ items("Work Items", work_items) }}{{ items("External References", external_references) }}{% endif %}
### Context

{{ prose(context) }}{{ text("Background", background) }}{{ text("Problem Statement", problem_statement) }}### Decision

{{ prose(decision) }}{{ text("Chosen Approach", chosen_approach) }}{{ items("Key Principles", key_principles) }}### Rationale

{{ prose(rationale) }}{{ items("Benefits", benefits) }}{{ items("Trade-offs", trade_offs) }}### Consequences

{{ prose(consequences) }}{{ items("Positive", positive) }}{{ items("Negative", negative) }}{{ items("Neutral", neutral) }}{% if alternatives %}
### Alternatives Considered

{% for group in alternatives %}
#### Alternative {{ loop.index }}: {{ group.name }}

{{ text("Description", group.description) }}{{ items("Pros", group.pros) }}{{ items("Cons", group.cons) }}{{ text("Why Rejected", group.why_rejected) }}{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if implementation or key_components or integration_points or code_examples %}
### Implementation

{{ prose(implementation) }}{{ items("Key Components", key_components) }}{{ items("Integration Points", integration_points) }}{{ text("Code Examples", code_examples) }}{% endif %}
{% if impact_analysis or affected_components or performance_impact or security_impact or maintainability_impact %}
### Impact Analysis

{{ prose(impact_analysis) }}{{ text("Affected Components", affected_components) }}{{ text("Performance Impact", performance_impact) }}{{ text("Security Impact", security_impact) }}{{ text("Maintainability Impact", maintainability_impact) }}{% endif %}
